                    <div class="mb-4">
                        
                        <div class="info">

<h5>E-Score of an energy provider is average of 3 scores:</h5> 

    <h5><a style="border-bottom:1px solid orange; color:#696969" href="#A">A. Basics Score</a></h5>
    <h5><a style="border-bottom:1px solid orange; color:#696969" href="#B">B. Transparency Score</a></h5>
   <h5><a style="border-bottom:1px solid orange; color:#696969" href="#C">C. Operation Score</a></h5>
<br>

<h4 id="A">A. Basics Score</h4>

            <h5>1. Title Basics (10p)</h5>
                <h5> Title Uniqueness </h5>
             

                <h5> Title Relevance </h5>
                

                <h5> Title Clarity</h5>
                <h5> Title Format</h5>

<br>

            <h5>2. Identity Basics (8p)</h5>
                <h5> International Serial Number</h5>
                <h5> International Address</h5>
                <h5> International Category Code</h5>
                <h5> Website Online Address</h5>
   <br>
               
            <h5>3. Basic Information (7p)</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Aim &amp; Scope</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Cover Image</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Publishing Agenda</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Customer Guideline</h5>
      <br>    
        
            <h5>4. Energy Provider Staff Basics (8p)</h5>
                <h5> Staff Contactability</h5>
                <h5> Staff Adversity</h5>
                <h5> Staff Relevance</h5>
                <h5> Staff Level</h5>
             
       <br>     
               <h5> 5. Energy Price Basics (8p)</h5>
                <h5> Energy Price Hierarchy</h5>
                <h5> Energy Price Labels</h5>
                <h5> Energy Price Basic Labels</h5>
                <h5> Energy Price Basic Labels</h5>
             
<br>
<h4 id="B">B. Transparency Score </h4>

            <h5>1. Ownership Transparency (5p)</h5>
                <h5> Owner Identity Transparency</h5>
                <h5> Owner Location Transparency</h5>
                <h5> Owner Education Level Transparency</h5>
                <h5> Owner Contact Transparency</h5>
                <h5> Owner Affiliation Transparency</h5>
           <br>     
            <h5>2. Process Policy Transparency (5p)</h5>
                <h5> Authorship Policy</h5>
                <h5> Staff Policy</h5>
                <h5> Review Policy</h5>
                <h5> Selling Policy</h5>
                <h5> Post-Selling Policy</h5>
            <br>    
            <h5>3. Financial Policy Transparency (4p) </h5>
                <h5> Comapny Business Model Policy</h5>
                <h5> Customer Fee Policy</h5>
                <h5> Refund and Waiver Policy</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Discount Policy</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Advertising Policy</h5>
             <br>   
            <h5>4. Information Policy Transparency (4p)</h5>
                <h5> Copyright Policy</h5>
                <h5> Licencing Policy</h5>
                <h5> Plagiarism Identification Policy</h5>
                <h5> Privacy policy</h5>
                <h5> Terms of Use</h5>
        <br>
            <h5>5. Partners Transparency (4p)</h5>
                <h5> Research Misconduct Policy</h5>
                <h5> Content Falsification Policy</h5>
                <h5> Citation Falsification Policy</h5>
                <h5> Author names Falsification Policy</h5>
                <h5> Affiliation Falsification Policy</h5>
                
<br>
<h4 id="C">C. Operation Score  </h4>

            <h5>1. Technical Review Quality (10p)</h5>
                <h5> Problem Review Factor</h5>
                <h5> Customer Service Review Factor</h5>
                <h5> Handeling Customer Problem Factor</h5>
                <h5> Solution Checking Method Review Factor</h5>
                <h5> The Staff Behaviour Review Factor</h5>
                <br>        
            <h5>2. Service Speed (6p)</h5>
                <h5> Submission to Initiate Review Speed</h5>
                <h5> Paper Review Speed</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Decision Speed</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Decision to Customer notification Speed</h5>
                <h5> Final Decision Speed</h5>
                <br>
            <h5>4. Servicing Timing Quality (7p)</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Strict Acknowledgement Time Factor</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Strict Review Factor</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Post-Service Time Factor</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Service Regularity</h5>
                <h5> Energy Provider Service Persistency</h5>
                <br>
            <h5>5. Service Maintenance (4p)</h5>
                <h5> Post Service Factory Improving Factor</h5>
                <h5> Post Service Home Improving Factor</h5>
                <h5> Post Service Shop Improving Factor</h5>
                <h5> Post Service Timing Improving Factor</h5>
                <h5> Post Service Creativity Improving Factor</h5>

<br>
